1.3 Bot API JSON-svar

GET https://api.telegram.org/bot[TOKEN]/getUpdates

Svar (JSON-utdrag):
{
  "ok": true,
  "result": [{
    "update_id": 987654321,
    "message": {
      "message_id": 42,
      "from": {
        "id": 1234567890,    ← Telegram user_id (permanent)
        "first_name": "Ola",
        "username": "alias",
        "language_code": "no"
      },
      "chat": {"id": -1001234567890},  ← Gruppe/kanal-ID
      "date": 1713692400,  ← Unix-timestamp UTC
      "text": "🍃 100g available 📍"
    }
  }]
}
